{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Metroidvania set in a decayed, dream-like world. It includes both visual beauty and a high degree of freedom. The player explores a ruined but visually impressive environment and encounters large, disturbing organisms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom</strong><br>Interactions such as cutting, connecting, controlling, duplicating, detonating, and preserving objects or living creatures are possible.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Design</strong><br>The setting is a post-apocalyptic dystopia. Detailed graphics are presented within the ruined environment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound</strong><br>The music uses tones that are slightly nostalgic and sometimes unsettling, with melodies that accompany the player\u2019s exploration.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is to destroy all organs called \u201cMADO,\u201d which emit the light of decay into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free, and you are not required to be bound by anything.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943840?t=1769867728","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943840?t=1769867728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943840/0f8299be0fb3ba14f174e8d16bf1c67dd9ae387a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769867728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943840/0f8299be0fb3ba14f174e8d16bf1c67dd9ae387a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769867728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc